      "content": "that makes sense. but even if the \"method\" is neutral, don't you think there's a problem if the results almost always seem to favor more conservative outcomes in modern cases? like, if the application of the theory consistently aligns with one side of the aisle, doesn't that make it a partisan framework in practice, regardless of what the scholars say?",
